Cristina Calderón, a Barcelona-based visual artist, needed a repair for "Un gris expansivo," her installation at Museo La Neomudéjar in Madrid — a piece combining models, light projections, programming, and electronic mechanisms.

I fixed the design to be more reliable and replaced the torch she'd been using with a brighter light that could last the whole day, running unattended through the museum's opening hours.

[Museo La Neomudéjar](https://www.laneomudejar.com/un-gris-expansivo-cristina-calderon/) · [Cristina Calderón](https://cristinacalderon.cat/)
